# Intended-exposure baseline — nas (Synology DS920+ 192.168.10.4)
# fix-51 (fleet-sweep SM56/SM58). Consumed by bin/listener-drift.sh.
#
# ALL-INTERFACE (0.0.0.0 / * / [::]) TCP LISTEN ports EXPECTED on the NAS and
# WHY. The NAS mixes DSM-native daemons (nginx web station, NFS/SMB file
# sharing, Synology services) with the *arr/media docker stack (docker-proxy
# publishes each UI on 0.0.0.0). All LAN-bound, not WAN-exposed. Media UIs are
# fronted by Caddy on mini for auth; direct-LAN access bypasses that (accepted,
# same tradeoff as mini/rig — see wiki runbook lan-exposure.md). Entries labelled
# "DSM" are Synology-native and should not be firewalled without DSM breakage.
# NAS:9999 here is a legitimate docker-proxy container (NOT the rogue mini nc).
#
# Format: one port per line; text after # is a comment.
22      # sshd (host)
53      # adguardhome — fleet DNS (net-16: containers resolve via NAS .4)
80      # nginx — DSM / reverse-proxy HTTP
111     # rpcbind — NFS portmapper (DSM)
139     # smbd — SMB/NetBIOS (DSM)
443     # nginx — DSM / reverse-proxy HTTPS
445     # smbd — SMB (DSM)
662     # statd — NFS status monitor (DSM)
892     # mountd — NFS mount (DSM)
2049    # nfsd — NFS (DSM)
2283    # immich — server
3000    # docker-proxy container
3261    # DSM Synology native service
3263    # DSM Synology native service
3264    # DSM Synology native service
3265    # DSM Synology native service
3333    # docker-proxy container
3334    # docker-proxy container
4045    # nlockmgr — NFS lock manager (DSM)
5000    # nginx — DSM Web UI (HTTP)
5001    # nginx — DSM Web UI (HTTPS)
5357    # nginx — WSDAPI / DSM
5566    # DSM Synology native service
5656    # docker-proxy container
6767    # bazarr
6969    # docker-proxy container
7878    # radarr
8080    # docker-proxy container
8083    # docker-proxy container
8084    # docker-proxy container
8090    # docker-proxy container
8092    # kiwix-serve — offline ZIM knowledge library (lai-12)
8096    # jellyfin
8191    # flaresolverr
8337    # docker-proxy container
8384    # syncthing — GUI
8686    # lidarr
8789    # docker-proxy container
8790    # docker-proxy container
8989    # sonarr
9696    # prowlarr
9999    # docker-proxy container (legit — NOT the mini nc)
13378   # audiobookshelf
22000   # syncthing — sync protocol
25600   # komga
32400   # plex
